# Keep the build context small and secret-free: dependencies and build output are
# rebuilt inside the image; local env files never leave the machine.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.pem
**/*.key
.git
.github
infrastructure/terraform
infrastructure/helm
docs
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.DS_Store
